<title>HUNGARY: Lufthansa to sell cargo for SAS in Hungary.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa to sell cargo for SAS in Hungary.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>German national airline Deutsche Lufthansa AG said on Friday it planned to become the general sales agent for cargo in Hungary for Scandinavian Airline Systems (SAS) starting in May.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect to sign the contract with SAS at the end of April,&quot; Peter Mojen, director of the Budapest office of Lufthansa subsidiary  Lufthansa Cargo AG, told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Ryan Tutak, Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
